[0m[0m
Two test-harness bugs of mine also surfaced and were fixed, neither a translation defect: an RNG desync that built different arrays for the two libraries, and passing output arguments under [38;5;10mJSON_VALIDATE_ONLY[0m, where the C consumes none — which shifts the vararg list so the next output pointer is read as a key.[0m[0m
